# Trackerbee Auto-Check
When starting a new conversation, automatically check for new Trackerbee tickets:
- Call @trackerbee get_recent_tickets {"hours_ago": 4}
- If new tickets exist, summarize them briefly
- Highlight any high-priority tickets

# Workflow Integration
- Before implementing features, suggest checking @trackerbee for related feedback
- After shipping features, remind to move tickets to "shipped" status

